@crew v-rocha-dilan
// Writer 4, batch 5: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh, hi. Sorry. Dilan Rocha. Charts. Am I in your seat?
- Hello. I'm only here a few days. I'll keep out of the way.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. I saved you the window seat. Well. Half of it.   #warm
?

== chat
- I draw the view from every ship I'm on. This one's the best so far.
- The pencils are behind my ears so I don't lose them. I lose them anyway.   #funny

== near
? place:lounge
- That window. I could draw it all week. I think I will.
? time:night
- More stars at night. Obviously. Sorry. It's just nice.
?

== bye
- {bye}. Thanks for talking to me. Really.   #warm

== smalltalk
